/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   STREAMLIT-INSPIRED PYSIDE6 THEME
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

QMainWindow {
    background-color: #FAFAFA;
}

QWidget {
    background-color: #FAFAFA;
}

/* ─── TABS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QTabWidget::pane {
    border: none;
    background: white;
    border-top: 1px solid #E0E0E0;
}

QTabBar::tab {
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    background-color: #FAFAFA;
    color: #6B7280;
    border: none;
    margin-right: 4px;
}

QTabBar::tab:hover {
    background-color: #F3F4F6;
    color: #374151;
}

QTabBar::tab:selected {
    background: white;
    color: #0068C9;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #0068C9;
    border-top: none;
}

/* ─── BUTTONS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QPushButton {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background-color: #0068C9;
    color: white;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: none;
    min-height: 36px;
}

QPushButton:hover {
    background-color: #0055A4;
    padding: 10px 20px;
}

QPushButton:pressed {
    background-color: #003D82;
}

QPushButton:disabled {
    background-color: #D1D5DB;
    color: #9CA3AF;
}

/* ─── LABELS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QLabel {
    color: #1F2937;
    font-size: 13px;
}

/* ─── CHECKBOXES & RADIOBUTTONS ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QCheckBox {
    color: #1F2937;
    font-size: 13px;
    spacing: 6px;
}

QCheckBox::indicator {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:unchecked {
    background-color: white;
    border: 2px solid #D1D5DB;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:unchecked:hover {
    border: 2px solid #0068C9;
    background-color: #F0F7FF;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked {
    background-color: #0068C9;
    border: 2px solid #0068C9;
    border-radius: 4px;
    image: url(data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M13.5 3L6 10.5 2.5 7" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>);
}

/* ─── TEXT INPUTS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QLineEdit, QTextEdit {
    background-color: white;
    border: 1px solid #D1D5DB;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    color: #1F2937;
    font-size: 13px;
    selection-background-color: #0068C9;
}

QLineEdit:focus, QTextEdit:focus {
    border: 2px solid #0068C9;
    padding: 7px 11px;
}

/* ─── PROGRESS BAR ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QProgressBar {
    background-color: #E5E7EB;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    height: 8px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #0068C9;
    font-size: 11px;
}

QProgressBar::chunk {
    background-color: #0068C9;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

/* ─── TABLES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QTableWidget {
    background-color: white;
    gridline-color: #E5E7EB;
    border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
    border-radius: 6px;
}

QTableWidget::item {
    padding: 8px;
    color: #1F2937;
}

QTableWidget::item:selected {
    background-color: #DBEAFE;
    color: #1F2937;
}

QHeaderView::section {
    background-color: #F9FAFB;
    color: #374151;
    padding: 8px;
    border: none;
    border-right: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 12px;
}

/* ─── SCROLL BARS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QScrollBar:vertical {
    background-color: #F9FAFB;
    width: 12px;
    border: none;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical {
    background-color: #D1D5DB;
    border-radius: 6px;
    min-height: 20px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover {
    background-color: #9CA3AF;
}

QScrollBar::add-line:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-line:vertical {
    height: 0;
}

QScrollBar:horizontal {
    background-color: #F9FAFB;
    height: 12px;
    border: none;
}

QScrollBar::handle:horizontal {
    background-color: #D1D5DB;
    border-radius: 6px;
    min-width: 20px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:horizontal:hover {
    background-color: #9CA3AF;
}

QScrollBar::add-line:horizontal, QScrollBar::sub-line:horizontal {
    width: 0;
}

/* ─── GROUPBOX ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QGroupBox {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #1F2937;
    border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 8px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    padding-right: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
}

QGroupBox::title {
    subcontrol-origin: margin;
    subcontrol-position: top left;
    left: 10px;
    padding: 0 4px;
}

/* ─── SPINBOX ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
QSpinBox, QDoubleSpinBox {
    background-color: white;
    border: 1px solid #D1D5DB;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 6px;
    color: #1F2937;
    font-size: 13px;
}

QSpinBox:focus, QDoubleSpinBox:focus {
    border: 2px solid #0068C9;
    padding: 5px;
}